This project bundles the LiquidGlass QML component and GLSL shaders from
liquidglass-kde-widgets by jaxparrow07, commit
0d1b9fe34ca3d21fc6f31b599990490d637ce8f8 (GPL-3.0-only).

The upstream files are preserved under contents/ui/components/ and
contents/ui/components/shaders/. The Control Center layout and its card
components are separate work. The wallpaper transition handler uses the
lexical ShaderEffectSource id directly, since the upstream root item does not
expose that child id as a property. The upstream attribution and GPL-3.0
license remain applicable to the bundled files.


Cupertino Icons font asset, version 2.0.0, maintained by the Flutter project:
https://github.com/flutter/packages/tree/main/third_party/packages/cupertino_icons
https://pub.dev/packages/cupertino_icons

The bundled `CupertinoIcons.ttf` is rendered directly for the Wi-Fi, Bluetooth,
media, window arrangement, Focus, brightness, and volume glyphs. The
Control-Center-specific AirDrop, Stage Manager, Screen Mirroring, Appearance,
audio-output, and applet symbols are project-created SVGs, covered by this
repository's GPL-3.0 license.
