The screenshot glyph at `contents/ui/components/icons/screenshot.svg` adapts
the `camera_viewfinder` vector from Cupertino Icons SVG 0.1.0, which exports
the Cupertino Icons font glyph. Its viewBox and upper/lower corner colors were
modified for the supplied Tahoe reference. Source:
https://github.com/ayuka-bg/cupertino-icons-svg
The Cupertino Icons copyright and MIT terms above apply.

The panel widget uses the Control Centre icon, asset 1569043 from IconScout:
https://cdn.iconscout.com/icon/free/png-512/free-control-centre-icon-svg-download-png-1569043.png?f=webp&w=256
The original WebP and a white PNG recolor are bundled for the Plasma panel.
The recolor preserves the source alpha and silhouette. IconScout license
terms: https://iconscout.com/licenses

